---
config:
  theme: default
title: Application Tracking FSM
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Applied: User tracks application
    
    Applied --> Shortlisted: Receives callback
    Applied --> Rejected: No response
    Applied --> Withdrawn: User withdraws
    
    Shortlisted --> Interview: Interview scheduled
    Shortlisted --> Rejected: Rejected after screening
    Shortlisted --> Withdrawn: User withdraws
    
    Interview --> Offer: Receives job offer
    Interview --> Rejected: Failed interview
    Interview --> Withdrawn: User withdraws
    
    Offer --> Withdrawn: Declined offer
    Offer --> [*]: Accepted (End state)
    
    Rejected --> [*]
    Withdrawn --> [*]
    
    note right of Applied
        Initial state when user
        tracks a job application
    end note
    
    note right of Interview
        Can add multiple interview
        rounds with dates & notes
    end note
    
    note right of Offer
        Final positive state
        before acceptance
    end note
